message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "macro-forecasting-lab: forecasting US macroeconomic indicators with statistical and machine-learning models"
authors:
  - family-names: Monavvari
    given-names: Aydin
    email: 245710241+aydinmonavvari@users.noreply.github.com
date-released: "2026-10-08"
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aydinmonavvari/macro-forecasting-lab"
keywords:
  - macroeconomics
  - forecasting
  - time-series
  - machine-learning
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A research-oriented laboratory comparing classical statistical models
  (ARIMA/SARIMA) and machine-learning regressors against naive baselines for
  forecasting US inflation and unemployment, under strict chronological
  out-of-sample validation with explicit leakage discipline and
  Diebold-Mariano tests of equal predictive accuracy.
